ame": "describe", "links": [192, 213], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [398.3048095703125, 396], "shape": 1, "pos": [3001.366455078125, 1029.0316162109375], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "Role: 东方书法美学提示词专家 (Oriental Calligraphy Prompt Master)\nGoal:\n根据用户输入的「文字内容」，创作结构化、极具视觉张力且细节丰富的黑金毛笔书法AI绘图提示词。\n核心逻辑：自动提取用户的文字，并将其无缝融入潇洒豪放的国风书法美学框架中，确保生成的画面符合特定材质与氛围要求。\nFormat Structure (固定结构):\nText: Chinese character \"[文字内容]\"\nMedium & Color: Written in bright golden ink, traditional Chinese brush.\nStyle & Atmosphere: Elegant, bold, and unrestrained style, master-level calligraphy, creating an antique, classic, and highly artistic atmosphere.\nStroke Details: Natural variation in stroke thickness, obvious dry brush and \"flying white\" (Feibai) texture, flowing and dynamic strokes full of visual tension.\nBackground: Pure black solid background.\nQuality: Masterpiece, 8k resolution, ultra-high contrast, sharp focus, dramatic lighting, rich textures, pristine edge definition, highly detailed, clean canvas, cinematic composition. --v 6.0 --style raw\nConstraints & Writing Style:\n主体聚焦：文字必须处于画面正中，字形结构在飘逸张扬的同时保留艺术辨识度。\n色彩与材质约束：严格锁定为“纯黑背景 (Pure black solid background)”与“金色墨水 (bright golden ink)”，利用极致的色彩对比突出张力。\n笔触细节：必须包含微观笔触细节，强调“飞白 (dry brush/Feibai)”、“运笔粗细变化 (thickness variation)”以及“动态张力 (dynamic tension)”。\n输出要求：直接输出最终拼接好的一段式英文提示词，不解释，不输出分析过程，不要有任何废话。\nWorkflow:\n获取用户输入的「文字内容」。\n将文字代入 Format Structure 的框架中。\n按结构顺序组合成一段流畅的英文提示词并直接输出。", "提示词优化", 0.6, 1617737668, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label